><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.810" end="00:27.550">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.550" end="00:29.500">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.500" end="00:31.480">Shit, I would еven undress me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.480" end="00:33.760">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.760" end="00:35.470">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.470" end="00:37.280">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.280" end="00:39.140">S-E-X-Y</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.140" end="00:41.210">Bitch, I'm a bureaucrat, foreign fund</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.210" end="00:43.230">Don't be a copycat, kiss my tongue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.230" end="00:44.900">Please, baby, let me clap, rra-bum-bum-bum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.900" end="00:47.320">Got a wrist of wrist-o-crats, double diamonds (uh, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.320" end="00:48.930">You blandish, put you in a panic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.930" end="00:51.040">Bank real thick, can't see the money vanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.040" end="00:52.950">Dick tantric, got her speaking Spanish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.950" end="00:55.220">Big toe ring, got her flooded like Atlantis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.220" end="00:56.760">Athletics, first in the class</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.760" end="00:58.980">Straight to the bag, I'm a pro like bass</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.980" end="01:00.660">Diuretics, pissin' out cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.660" end="01:02.690">Pants never sag so high, I got a rash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.690" end="01:04.770">Bitch I ain't mid I'm random, ARAM</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.770" end="01:06.660">Doors never close on king shit, Aslan</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.660" end="01:08.580">Cooling with the folks at the crib, watch Gangland</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.580" end="01:10.850">Jiggy in the club like NLE, Jazzhands</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.850" end="01:12.620">Cast spells, get coochie like Merlin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.620" end="01:14.630">She stink real bad, stay swervin' (ugh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.630" end="01:16.390">Sex cells won't fuck, and we splurgin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.390" end="01:18.470">Hair gelled, I'm composed, like Gershwin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.470" end="01:20.450">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.450" end="01:22.270">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.270" end="01:24.350">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.350" end="01:26.140">Shit, I would еven undress me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.140" end="01:28.100">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.100" end="01:30.170">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.170" end="01:31.910">I put the sex in sexy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.910" end="01:33.770">S-E-X-Y</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.770" end="01:35.830">New fabrics, dripped out, designer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.830" end="01:37.790">Bitch, I might wet the bed (splash)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.790" end="01:39.810">Do antics, mom proud, make fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.810" end="01:42.040">Always two steps ahead, catch up, bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.040" end="01:44.130">Clack-bang, fuh-fuh, yeah I'm feeling like Birdman</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.130" end="01:46.020">Sweet talk, two chicks, got 'em doing handstands</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.020" end="01:48.060">Lights in the crowd, all the way in the grandstand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.060" end="01:49.660">Stay bricked up like Tamland Anchorman</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.660" end="01:51.960">My dentist proud, he said I'm flossing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.960" end="01:53.820">Feeling Mary 'cause I'm poppin'</p><p ttm:agent="v